  "body": "Adds a 'Labels' step to `/review-prs`:\n- green `merge-ready`: review clean and the PR merges cleanly;\n- red `needs-rework`: the review found blockers;\n- orange `conflicts`: it conflicts with main and needs a branch refresh.\n\nA conflicting PR is never green. Refreshing a branch drops `conflicts` once it's mergeable, and every run re-checks green PRs, since merging one can make others conflict.\n\nNote: the main checkout holds another session's uncommitted edits to this same skill file (the earlier merge-ready rules). Those will need reconciling with this when they're committed.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
